 const p1=`Education is not reduced to “will study / will not study.” Houses 2 and 4 describe foundational learning and home learning environment, 3 effort/practice, 5 intelligence and memory, 6 exams/competition, 9 higher learning, and 11 fulfilment. Mercury supports comprehension/language/calculation, Moon receptivity and memory, Jupiter advanced learning and guidance${ed.d24Available?'; D24 is used as an additional educational cross-check':'; D24 is unavailable and is therefore not counted as negative evidence'}.`;
 const p2=`Capacity profile: foundation — ${v252BandLabel(b.foundation,lang)}; primary schooling — ${v252BandLabel(b.primary,lang)}; secondary schooling — ${v252BandLabel(b.secondary,lang)}; higher-secondary/exams — ${v252BandLabel(b.higherSecondary,lang)}; higher education — ${v252BandLabel(higher,lang)}. Concentration — ${v252BandLabel(conc,lang)}; exam/competition — ${v252BandLabel(exam,lang)}.`;
 const p3=higher==='strong'||higher==='support'?`The natal promise does not deny higher education; ${higher==='strong'?'a clear foundation is present':'the possibility is present but course fit, support and timing determine how far it develops'}. This is not a chart that should be declared “education ends at the basics.”`:higher==='mixed'?`Higher education is conditional rather than absent. A technical, vocational or skill-led route can sometimes express ability better than a purely academic route, and study can revive under supportive periods.`:`Higher study may face more interruption or changing interest, but this should not be translated as “cannot study.” Foundation repair, practical/skill routes, good teaching and timing become more important.`;
 const p4=`Education significators: ${strong.length?`${strong.join(', ')} are relatively supportive.`:'No single planet alone decides the whole result.'}${weak.length?` ${weak.join(', ')} needs more deliberate support in the function it represents.`:''}`;
 const p5=weak.includes('Mercury')?'When Mercury is weaker, use short daily revision, written practice and stepwise language/mathematics foundations first; traditional Mercury/Vishnu observance can be optional support, not a substitute for study.':weak.includes('Moon')?'When Moon is weaker, sleep, food rhythm, emotional safety and study routine come first; a Monday devotional practice can be optional support.':weak.includes('Jupiter')?'When Jupiter is weaker, strong teachers/mentors, conceptual understanding and long-course guidance matter more; Thursday Guru-oriented charity/devotion can be optional support.':'Remedial priority is practical: good teaching, sleep, daily revision, subject fit and measurable practice; traditional worship is optional support.';
